// IntroString :
"P1317118801" "I have an offer that I think will interest you, {HeroName}. One of our order has been researching the rites used by the Banished Pantheon to channel Mot's power. It is our belief that we have discovered a method with which we can claim that power for our own, but we will need access to one of their altars in order to perform the rite. If you can escort my colleague to one of these altars, perhaps we can arrange for you to gain Mot's blessing as well."
// AcceptString :
"P2495444002" "Perform the Rite of Death"
// SendOffString :
"P3483742918" "I'm glad you see the benefits of this arrangement. We have traced the location of one of the Pantheon's ritual altars to an abandoned office building nearby. My colleague will meet you there."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P645333375" "You return unempowered, {HeroName}. Have you not completed the ritual?"
// TaskTitle :
"P44363897" "<color deepskyblue>Death Magic</color>"

