// IntroString :
"P4081178322" "Ah, {HeroName}. You're here. I half-expected that the Talons would have finished their ritual by now.<br><br>As it turns out, the Talons of Vengeance have been preparing to summon one of their adversaries into their lair, where they can ambush {Hero.gender=male him|her} and get rid of {Hero.gender=male him|her} for good. I only just received word that their latest target was going to be you, {HeroName}. Now, far be it from me to tell you what to do, but I would think this little tidbit of information demands some sort of reaction, don't you?"
// AcceptString :
"P1981273555" "Ambush the Talons of Vengeance"
// SendOffString :
"P627615108" "Mmm, I thought as much. I can direct you to where they are hosting the ritual meant to summon you into their trap. Perhaps with a little initiative, you could spring the trap on them first, yes?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1244344449" "The longer you dawdle, the more likely the Talons will complete their ritual. It should make for convenient transportation, to be sure, but I doubt that <i>compulsory summoning</i> is your preferred method of travel."
// TaskTitle :
"P3727090871" "<color deepskyblue>To Catch a {HeroName}</color>"

