// IntroString :
"P2989623264" "This... may seem an odd request, {HeroName}, but hear me out. The Tsoo are preparing a massive force, with the intention of striking at Mot directly and slaying him. I would ask that you prevent them from doing so.<br><br>While I am fairly certain their attack will fail, it represents a risk to both of our interests in the deity. I would 'rather be safe than sorry,' so to speak. If either of us are to take advantage of Mot's awakened state in this city, then we will need the creature to remain intact a while longer."
// AcceptString :
"P882125271" "Scatter the Tsoo Forces"
// SendOffString :
"P687612752" "I'm glad you agree. We have observed the Tsoo's movements for some time now. If you strike at one of their gathering places, preferably a place where their leaders can meet, then I'm sure you'll be able to disrupt their immediate plans."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3704249850" "I fear the Tsoo still have a sizable force available, {HeroName}. Perhaps not enough to threaten Mot... <i>perhaps</i>."
// TaskTitle :
"P3097023536" "<color deepskyblue>Culling the Competition</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1286256639" "The Tsoo are playing well out of their league. It's time to remind them of that fact."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2756509065" "Soon, we will strike, and this nightmare will end."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
