"P3721126732" "The fortunes turn in our favor, {HeroName}. I have learned of a Tsoo mystic that claims to know of a way to guard his allies against Mot's corrupting influence. If true, this power could be the key to gaining an advantage in Dark Astoria. Would you care to investigate?"
// AcceptString :
"P3086783963" "Kidnap the Tsoo Mystic"
// SendOffString :
"P911614683" "Wonderful. I have traced the aura of his spiritual craft to a nearby warehouse. I do not know how many of the Tsoo currently reside there, but I'm sure you are capable of managing them yourself."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3306452792" "No mystic, no protection? I warn you, {HeroName}... as powerful as you are, it would not do to underestimate Mot's power. Were I you, I would take every advantage afforded to me."
// TaskTitle :
"P4118838076" "<color deepskyblue>Armor of the Soul</color>"

