// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P466243638" "We arrive at a moment of opportunity, {HeroName}. The Tsoo, in all of their wisdom, have decided to strike at the newly-formed Knives of Vengeance, in an attempt to clear the field of Dark Astoria, as it were. In this task, they are overmatched, and the Knives are poised to gain ground against their attackers.<br><br>This, of course, means the Tsoo have become desperate. Desperate enough to accept the help of one that clearly does not have their best interests at heart... I'm sure you understand my meaning?"
// AcceptString :
"P4131955739" "Eliminate the Competition"
// SendOffString :
"P2584861610" "You will find the Tsoo and the Knives fighting in a series of underground cave networks nearby. I have no doubt that you will be the only one to emerge from those caves."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1017734997" "The Tsoo and the Knives remain strong, {HeroName}. Do you not see a chance here, to weaken two enemies at once?"
// TaskTitle :
"P535584316" "<color deepskyblue>Two Birds</color>"

