// IntroString :
"P1499519880" "I fear I must ask a favor of you, {HeroName}. The Circle of Thorns has relatively little influence in Dark Astoria, when compared with Mot's growing power. We do, however, have the advantage of not being somewhat... outside of Mot's area of influence. Our order has placed ley anchors down in key locations, which prevent Mot from claiming the spirits of our members.<br><br>Unfortunately, the Knives of Vengeance have discovered some of these anchors, and plan to destroy them. I understand that you are not in the habit of charity, {HeroName}, but I would remind you that the Circle remains one of your precious few allies in Dark Astoria... and allies are worth protecting, yes?"
// AcceptString :
"P3715503298" "Prevent the Destruction of the Ley Anchors"
// SendOffString :
"P1613694825" "I am most gracious at your assistance, {HeroName}. I will show you the location of the anchors that are in jeopardy. I assure you, your efforts will not be forgotten. The Circle always pays its debts."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P399413833" "I beseech you, {HeroName}, do not tarry in this. We are on the verge of being expelled from Dark Astoria entirely."
// TaskTitle :
"P1384367326" "<color deepskyblue>Allies and Anchors</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1082397469" "If this sort of thing keeps up, the Circle may end up being more of a nuisance than they're worth."
