"P2922523265" "{HeroName}, I am deeply sorry. It appears that the Banished Pantheon have named you, as one of Mot's favored targets. I am afraid that once the creature's eyes are upon you, you will have little hope of surviving with your sanity intact.<br><br>That is... unless you were to confront the Pantheon directly. Mot is only peripherally aware of your exploits. Without his followers to name you, he would be blind to your doings in Dark Astoria..."
